{"blocks":[{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/06/3155544/0013.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いつもより"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"14%大きくて、30%明るい"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"スーパームーン"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなさん見ましたかね??"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"スーパームーンって名前、可愛いね!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"スーパームーン。すーぱーむーん。(o・ω・o)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"んーきれいだった!!!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/06/3155544/0012.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こどもの日わ何した〜?(*^_^*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"久しぶりに地元の子とメールしたり"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"たこやき器にホットケーキミックス入れてみたり"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あれーこどもの日らしいことやってない!わら"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ゆーわけで学校関係の質問をまとめてお答えしますどーん♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/06/3155544/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"仕事忙しいと思うけど、高校では部活に入る予定はある?"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/06/3155544/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"高校では部活やるの???"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"検討なーう(>_<)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/06/3155544/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"高校生になったら赤点と言うものがあって"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"進級に関わると言うことなんですがそこら辺についてどう思いますか??"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それなっ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もう不安ですよ。ひめたん自信なーい。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"中元さんはテスト前に死にそうになって詰める人だから多分どーにかなる♪わら"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/06/3155544/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"クラスの人たちはひめたんがアイドルってこと知ってるの?"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/06/3155544/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"高校では乃木坂だって言ってるの?"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/06/3155544/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"クラスの同級生に「乃木坂46のひめたん?」って聞かれなかった?"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/06/3155544/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"高校のクラスメイトはひめたんが乃木坂のメンバーってみんな知ってるの??"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ってかひめたんが先に行ったの?"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"わからんけど知っとると思いますよ(^ω^)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひめたんからはそりゃ言いませんよ。噂ってのはすごいんだからっ!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも、みんなアイドルでなく「クラスメートの中元さん」として"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"仲良くしてくれてるから居心地がいいの♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"アイドル?ねえアイドルなの???みたいな感じにはならなーい!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/06/3155544/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"日芽香ちゃんの通う高校には食堂などはありますか?"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ありますよん(ω)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でもまだ行ったことなーい!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/06/3155544/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひめたんから見てかわいい、乃木坂に入れそうな女の子はいましたか?"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それが冗談抜きで、まじで!かわいい子めーっちゃ多いの!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"乃木坂でも学校でも"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"周りかわいい子しかいないみたいな幸せな環境です♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/06/3155544/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"友達何人できましたか??"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"1、2、3、...何人じゃろ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"とりあえずクラスの子はみーんな仲良くしてくれるから友達ってことで。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"他のクラスの子もあわせたら50人はいくんじゃないでしょーうか!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"100人まであとはんぶーん☆"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/06/3155544/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"高校でがんばりたい科目って、特にある?"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"全部っちゃ全部じゃけど、やっぱり苦手なやつ頑張らんといけんよねー..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"数学、あと物理生物、体育!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/06/3155544/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"早くもクラスのアイドルになったのかな?"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"んなことないなーい"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/06/3155544/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/06/3155544/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/06/3155544/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひめたんのクラスは係とか委員会はきまったのかな(・x・。)?"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"決まった＼(^O^)／"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今回は委員会ならんかったけど、係でクラスに貢献しますっ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/06/3155544/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"高校のいいとこは?"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みんな個性が光ってて、でもやるときはやる!みたいか子が多いとこ(*^^*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ねー素敵でしょ☆?"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/06/3155544/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"高校生活はどう?"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"めっちゃ楽しい!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もう本当に楽しすぎてやーばいってくらい楽しい!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"課題が難しかったり、生活リズムが掴めなかったりはするけど"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それに勝る楽しさがありますよ(*^^*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/06/3155544/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"友達と休み時間に何の話するの??乃木坂の話、したりする?"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"めっちゃ普通に世間話。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひめたん情報疎いから、いろんな話が聞けて面白ーいですよ(^ω^)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"乃木坂の話題になることもあるけどって感じ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/06/3155544/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"勉強たいへん??"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"んー大変っ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"教科数が増えて頭がごちゃごちゃするー!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/06/3155544/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"50メートルなんぼやった?"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おっそいよ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/06/3155544/0010.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"わら"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/06/3155544/0011.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"自転車乗れる?"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"乗れますよ(`・ω・')どや"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちっちゃいときからちゃり通憧れてたんだけど"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"実際ちゃり使ってなーい!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/06/3155544/0011.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"授業中、お腹鳴ったらどうする?(笑)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"んーその前に、休憩時間になるたんびにお友達がお菓子くれるけどー、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"とりあえず自分的に大事件だよね///"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも周りの子には案外聞こえてなかったりするもんだよきっと♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ゆーわけでなかったことにすーる!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"(*´・ω・*)ひめたん"}],"source":"archive"}